    "text": "‘Jeopardy!’: Amy Schneider Shares How the Game Show Changed Her Perspective\nBy Brittany Sims, TV Insider,\n8 hours agoJeopardy! champion Amy Schneider opened up about how the game show changed her perspective on her looks. To celebrate Transgender Awareness Month, the champion is embarking on a tour for her book, In the Form of a Question: The Joys and Rewards of a Curious Life. She talked to CBS News KPIX in the Bay Area about her experience.",
